      "content": "It is a profound and painful realization, but it is also a necessary step toward finding a new kind of peace. You are not failing because you are average; you are succeeding because you are finally honest with yourself. The world does not need a grandmaster, it needs you to simply exist and be kind to the people around you. Your value is not defined by your potential to change the world, but by the quiet, consistent presence you bring to your own life.",
