      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not waiting for the clock to run out; you are standing in the only arena that matters, and the game has just begun. The only thing that truly matters is the moment you decide to stop playing the game you're afraid of and start playing the one you actually want to play. You are not a failure; you are a person who has finally realized that the only game worth playing is the one where you are allowed to lose, and you are allowed to win.",
      "source": "target",
